shrink.py is adapted from Caveman by Julius Brussee
(https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). It is a rewrite in Python of the ideas of
the compressors in engine/compressors (terminal, log, repetition, redundancy, json, tabular,
testreport). Changes: no dependency, no network, no retrieval store, English messages.

